&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Step into a career with ASM, where cutting edge technology meets collaborative culture. &lt;/strong&gt;​&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For over 55 years ASM has been ahead of what’s next, at the forefront of innovation and what’s technologically possible. With more than 4,500 ASMers representing 70 nationalities, our people and our advanced semiconductor devices are playing a crucial role in trends such as 5G, cloud computing, AI, and autonomous driving.  But&amp;nbsp;we’re more than just a tech company. We value diversity, inclusion and sustainability as we strive to make a positive impact on the world.&amp;nbsp; Our development programs help support your growth, shaping your future and pushing the boundaries of innovation to unleash potential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;ASM is a leading global provider of products, services, and materials for semiconductor processing. Innovation has been at the heart of everything we do for over half a century. The brilliant minds at ASM are dedicated to developing groundbreaking solutions for the world&#39;s leading semiconductor manufacturers. Every day, we drive the development of next-generation computer chip technologies, staying a few steps ahead of the future. Our talented and enthusiastic employees are just like you: committed to improving people&#39;s lives and unlocking new possibilities. Through a collaborative approach to research and development, we advance key semiconductor technologies and platforms such as ALD, epitaxy, PEALD, PECVD, and vertical furnaces. We have also recently entered the promising growth market of silicon carbide epitaxy. Year after year, our innovations help make chips smaller, faster, and more powerful. In fact, you can find our technology in every aspect of modern life: in artificial intelligence, medical devices, 5G, smartphones, autonomous driving, and more.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing installations, implementing new developments, and conducting qualification procedures, as well as carrying out preventive and corrective maintenance on complex electronic/electromechanical semiconductor equipment at ASM customer sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performing repairs during equipment downtime, collaborating in diverse teams, and developing and presenting proposed solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working on-site at various customer locations within cleanroom environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Willingness to travel: Within the ASM Europe region, we have many customers spread across the entire area. Therefore, a willingness to travel for business—both within Germany and to other European countries—is a requirement. Due to ASM’s growing international presence and expanding customer base, occasional business trips to North America or Asia may also be necessary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Mechatronics, Mechanical Engineering, Electrical Engineering, or Electronics (or equivalent knowledge); applications from certified master craftsmen and technicians are also welcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using measuring instruments and hand tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills (German and English)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in MS Office; SAP knowledge is an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ideal candidate brings initial professional experience in field service or customer support and has gained experience in the assembly and commissioning of systems, preferably within the semiconductor industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We also welcome applications from suitable entry-level candidates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Class B driver’s license mandatory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer at ASM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work for a leading provider of semiconductor process equipment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A varied and dynamic international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An attractive salary package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company car for business and private use&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At ASM, we are committed to supporting our employees and empowering them to develop their talents and perform at their best. We actively foster an inclusive and diverse culture built on trust and transparency. Our people are our strength, and we value the differences each individual brings, as they make us a better team. By embracing a wide range of perspectives, we cultivate a culture of continuous exploration and the adoption of new ideas. At every step, we recognize that it is our valued employees who enable us to deliver outstanding products and services to our customers—and to make a positive impact on society.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us on our journey. Discover how you can be part of our exciting future and apply today! To learn more about ASM, visit us at asm.com and on LinkedIn, Facebook, Instagram, and YouTube.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply today to be part of what’s next.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We make the tech that enables the chips in devices which improve lives around the world. We do this with an eye to the future, pushing the boundaries of what’s possible through cutting-edge innovation, and driving the next wave of technological breakthroughs that shape how we live, work, and connect.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_elementToProof&quot;&gt;To learn more about ASM, find us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.asm.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;asm.com&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/asm/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.facebook.com/ASMOfficialCompany&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;,&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/asmofficialcompany/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram,&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/ASMofficialco&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/c/ASM_Official&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
